WEBVTT

NOTE Lumora demo captions — original descriptive text written for this build.
NOTE Film: Sintel (Blender Foundation, CC-BY 3.0).

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[A lone figure crosses a snowy mountain pass, wind howling]

2
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
She asks a shaman about a dragon. The price of the answer is a story.

3
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Flashback: a wounded baby dragon falls into the street. Sintel takes it in.

4
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:06.000
She names him Scales. He grows fast — too fast for a small room.

5
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.000
They fly together over cliffs and clouds. A bond beyond words.

6
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:36.000
In the mountains, a larger dragon takes Scales. Sintel is thrown from the sky.

7
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:06.000
The hunt begins — across deserts, ships and snow, she never stops looking.

8
00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.000
[Swords ring. Sintel fights her way into the dragon's lair]

9
00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:36.000
The final duel ends in recognition — and grief. The scar on her arm tells the truth.

10
00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:36.000
Back in the present: the shaman listens. The wind answers for her.

11
00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:07.000
[End credits: Sintel — Blender Foundation, CC-BY]
